      "statement": "The index schema is one skill_index table plus a single-row index_state table; replaced_by, requires_tools, search_text and the tsvector search are STORED generated columns derived from metadata, with GIN indexes on the tsvector, a trigram index on search_text and an array index on requires_tools.",
