      "id": "claim_048dfe95aa7047469b49d1d668d3c29a",
      "statement": "replace_index performs the whole index replacement in one transaction: it takes a transaction-scoped advisory lock, locks the index_state row FOR UPDATE, returns STALE when a stored commit exists that differs from the new one and is not its ancestor, and otherwise deletes and re-inserts every row and upserts index_state.",
